    "resources": {
        "fortimanager:index/dvmCmdAddDevice:DvmCmdAddDevice": {
            "description": "Add a device to the Device Manager database.\n\n## Example Usage\n\n\u003c!--Start PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n```typescript\nimport * as pulumi from \"@pulumi/pulumi\";\nimport * as fortimanager from \"@pulumi/fortimanager\";\n\nconst trname = new fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDevice(\"trname\", {\n    fmgadom: \"root\",\n    device: {\n        ip: \"192.168.52.177\",\n        mgmtMode: \"fmg\",\n        name: \"terraform-tefv\",\n        admUsr: \"admin\",\n        admPass: \"admin\",\n    },\n});\n```\n```python\nimport pulumi\nimport pulumi_fortimanager as fortimanager\n\ntrname = fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDevice(\"trname\",\n    fmgadom=\"root\",\n    device={\n        \"ip\": \"192.168.52.177\",\n        \"mgmt_mode\": \"fmg\",\n        \"name\": \"terraform-tefv\",\n        \"adm_usr\": \"admin\",\n        \"adm_pass\": \"admin\",\n    })\n```\n```csharp\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing Pulumi;\nusing Fortimanager = Pulumi.Fortimanager;\n\nreturn await Deployment.RunAsync(() =\u003e \n{\n    var trname = new Fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDevice(\"trname\", new()\n    {\n        Fmgadom = \"root\",\n        Device = new Fortimanager.Inputs.DvmCmdAddDeviceDeviceArgs\n        {\n            Ip = \"192.168.52.177\",\n            MgmtMode = \"fmg\",\n            Name = \"terraform-tefv\",\n            AdmUsr = \"admin\",\n            AdmPass = \"admin\",\n        },\n    });\n\n});\n```\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"github.com/pulumi/pulumi-terraform-provider/sdks/go/fortimanager/fortimanager\"\n\t\"github.com/pulumi/pulumi/sdk/v3/go/pulumi\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\tpulumi.Run(func(ctx *pulumi.Context) error {\n\t\t_, err := fortimanager.NewDvmCmdAddDevice(ctx, \"trname\", \u0026fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDeviceArgs{\n\t\t\tFmgadom: pulumi.String(\"root\"),\n\t\t\tDevice: \u0026fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDeviceDeviceArgs{\n\t\t\t\tIp:       pulumi.String(\"192.168.52.177\"),\n\t\t\t\tMgmtMode: pulumi.String(\"fmg\"),\n\t\t\t\tName:     pulumi.String(\"terraform-tefv\"),\n\t\t\t\tAdmUsr:   pulumi.String(\"admin\"),\n\t\t\t\tAdmPass:  pulumi.String(\"admin\"),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t})\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn nil\n\t})\n}\n```\n```hcl\npulumi {\n  required_providers {\n    fortimanager = {\n      source = \"pulumi/fortimanager\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"fortimanager_dvmcmdadddevice\" \"trname\" {\n  fmgadom = \"root\"\n  device = {\n    ip        = \"192.168.52.177\"\n    mgmt_mode = \"fmg\"\n    name      = \"terraform-tefv\"\n    adm_usr   = \"admin\"\n    adm_pass  = \"admin\"\n  }\n}\n```\n```java\npackage generated_program;\n\nimport com.pulumi.Context;\nimport com.pulumi.Pulumi;\nimport com.pulumi.core.Output;\nimport com.pulumi.fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDevice;\nimport com.pulumi.fortimanager.DvmCmdAddDeviceArgs;\nimport com.pulumi.fortimanager.inputs.DvmCmdAddDeviceDeviceArgs;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.io.File;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Paths;\n\npublic class App {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Pulumi.run(App::stack);\n    }\n\n    public static void stack(Context ctx) {\n        var trname = new DvmCmdAddDevice(\"trname\", DvmCmdAddDeviceArgs.builder()\n            .fmgadom(\"root\")\n            .device(DvmCmdAddDeviceDeviceArgs.builder()\n                .ip(\"192.168.52.177\")\n                .mgmtMode(\"fmg\")\n                .name(\"terraform-tefv\")\n                .admUsr(\"admin\")\n                .admPass(\"admin\")\n                .build())\n            .build());\n\n    }\n}\n```\n```yaml\nresources:\n  trname:\n    type: fortimanager:DvmCmdAddDevice\n    properties:\n      fmgadom: root\n      device:\n        ip: 192.168.52.177\n        mgmtMode: fmg\n        name: terraform-tefv\n        admUsr: admin\n        admPass: admin\n```\n\u003c!--End PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n\n## Others\n\n\u003e **Warning:** This resource is an `execution` resource, which means it has no state consistency check function. After each execution, if you want to re-execute it, please use terraform taint or assign a different new value to `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FdvmCmdAddDevice:DvmCmdAddDevice/properties/forceRecreate %}}`, then apply it again.\n\n## Import\n\nDvm CmdAddDevice can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/dvmCmdAddDevice:DvmCmdAddDevice labelname DvmCmdAddDevice\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\n",
