        "fortimanager:index/objectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile": {
            "description": "Configure AntiVirus profiles.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/cifs %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileCifs:ObjectAntivirusProfileCifs %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/contentDisarm %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileContentdisarm:ObjectAntivirusProfileContentdisarm %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/ftp %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileFtp:ObjectAntivirusProfileFtp %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/http %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileHttp:ObjectAntivirusProfileHttp %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/imap %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileImap:ObjectAntivirusProfileImap %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/mapi %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileMapi:ObjectAntivirusProfileMapi %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/nacQuar %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileNacquar:ObjectAntivirusProfileNacquar %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/nntp %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileNntp:ObjectAntivirusProfileNntp %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/outbreakPrevention %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileOutbreakprevention:ObjectAntivirusProfileOutbreakprevention %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/pop3 %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfilePop3:ObjectAntivirusProfilePop3 %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/smb %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectAntivirusProfileSmb`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/smtp %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileSmtp:ObjectAntivirusProfileSmtp %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfile:ObjectAntivirusProfile/properties/ssh %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectAntivirusProfileSsh:ObjectAntivirusProfileSsh %}}`\n\n\n\n## Example Usage\n\n\u003c!--Start PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n```typescript\nimport * as pulumi from \"@pulumi/pulumi\";\nimport * as fortimanager from \"@pulumi/fortimanager\";\n\nconst trname = new fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfile(\"trname\", {\n    analyticsDb: \"disable\",\n    analyticsMaxUpload: 20,\n    avBlockLog: \"disable\",\n    avVirusLog: \"disable\",\n    comment: \"tefv comment\",\n    extendedLog: \"disable\",\n    ftgdAnalytics: \"disable\",\n    mobileMalwareDb: \"disable\",\n    name: \"terr-antivirus-profile\",\n    scanMode: \"default\",\n});\n```\n```python\nimport pulumi\nimport pulumi_fortimanager as fortimanager\n\ntrname = fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfile(\"trname\",\n    analytics_db=\"disable\",\n    analytics_max_upload=float(20),\n    av_block_log=\"disable\",\n    av_virus_log=\"disable\",\n    comment=\"tefv comment\",\n    extended_log=\"disable\",\n    ftgd_analytics=\"disable\",\n    mobile_malware_db=\"disable\",\n    name=\"terr-antivirus-profile\",\n    scan_mode=\"default\")\n```\n```csharp\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing Pulumi;\nusing Fortimanager = Pulumi.Fortimanager;\n\nreturn await Deployment.RunAsync(() =\u003e \n{\n    var trname = new Fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfile(\"trname\", new()\n    {\n        AnalyticsDb = \"disable\",\n        AnalyticsMaxUpload = 20,\n        AvBlockLog = \"disable\",\n        AvVirusLog = \"disable\",\n        Comment = \"tefv comment\",\n        ExtendedLog = \"disable\",\n        FtgdAnalytics = \"disable\",\n        MobileMalwareDb = \"disable\",\n        Name = \"terr-antivirus-profile\",\n        ScanMode = \"default\",\n    });\n\n});\n```\n```go\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"github.com/pulumi/pulumi-terraform-provider/sdks/go/fortimanager/fortimanager\"\n\t\"github.com/pulumi/pulumi/sdk/v3/go/pulumi\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\tpulumi.Run(func(ctx *pulumi.Context) error {\n\t\t_, err := fortimanager.NewObjectAntivirusProfile(ctx, \"trname\", \u0026fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfileArgs{\n\t\t\tAnalyticsDb:        pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tAnalyticsMaxUpload: pulumi.Float64(20),\n\t\t\tAvBlockLog:         pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tAvVirusLog:         pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tComment:            pulumi.String(\"tefv comment\"),\n\t\t\tExtendedLog:        pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tFtgdAnalytics:      pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tMobileMalwareDb:    pulumi.String(\"disable\"),\n\t\t\tName:               pulumi.String(\"terr-antivirus-profile\"),\n\t\t\tScanMode:           pulumi.String(\"default\"),\n\t\t})\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn nil\n\t})\n}\n```\n```hcl\npulumi {\n  required_providers {\n    fortimanager = {\n      source = \"pulumi/fortimanager\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"fortimanager_objectantivirusprofile\" \"trname\" {\n  analytics_db         = \"disable\"\n  analytics_max_upload = 20\n  av_block_log         = \"disable\"\n  av_virus_log         = \"disable\"\n  comment              = \"tefv comment\"\n  extended_log         = \"disable\"\n  ftgd_analytics       = \"disable\"\n  mobile_malware_db    = \"disable\"\n  name                 = \"terr-antivirus-profile\"\n  scan_mode            = \"default\"\n}\n```\n```java\npackage generated_program;\n\nimport com.pulumi.Context;\nimport com.pulumi.Pulumi;\nimport com.pulumi.core.Output;\nimport com.pulumi.fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfile;\nimport com.pulumi.fortimanager.ObjectAntivirusProfileArgs;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.io.File;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Paths;\n\npublic class App {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Pulumi.run(App::stack);\n    }\n\n    public static void stack(Context ctx) {\n        var trname = new ObjectAntivirusProfile(\"trname\", ObjectAntivirusProfileArgs.builder()\n            .analyticsDb(\"disable\")\n            .analyticsMaxUpload(20.0)\n            .avBlockLog(\"disable\")\n            .avVirusLog(\"disable\")\n            .comment(\"tefv comment\")\n            .extendedLog(\"disable\")\n            .ftgdAnalytics(\"disable\")\n            .mobileMalwareDb(\"disable\")\n            .name(\"terr-antivirus-profile\")\n            .scanMode(\"default\")\n            .build());\n\n    }\n}\n```\n```yaml\nresources:\n  trname:\n    type: fortimanager:ObjectAntivirusProfile\n    properties:\n      analyticsDb: disable\n      analyticsMaxUpload: 20\n      avBlockLog: disable\n      avVirusLog: disable\n      comment: tefv comment\n      extendedLog: disable\n      ftgdAnalytics: disable\n      mobileMalwareDb: disable\n      name: terr-antivirus-profile\n      scanMode: default\n```\n\u003c!--End PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n\n## Import\n\nObjectAntivirus Profile can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"