            "description": "Configure DLP profiles.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectDlpProfile:ObjectDlpProfile/properties/rule %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectDlpProfileRule:ObjectDlpProfileRule %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nObjectDlp Profile can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectDlpProfile:ObjectDlpProfile labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
