                    "description": "Wifi. The structure of `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofile:ObjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofile/properties/wifi %}}` block is documented below.\n"
                }
