        "fortimanager:index/objectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotificationReceiver:ObjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotificationReceiver": {
            "description": "SMS notification receiver list.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `receiver` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotification:ObjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotification %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nObjectExtensionController ExtenderProfileCellularSmsNotificationReceiver can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"extender_profile=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotificationReceiver:ObjectExtensioncontrollerExtenderprofileCellularSmsnotificationReceiver labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
