            "description": "IPv6 subnet segments.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `subnetSegment` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallAddress6DynamicMapping:ObjectFirewallAddress6DynamicMapping %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nObjectFirewall Address6DynamicMappingSubnetSegment can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"address6=YOUR_VALUE\", \"dynamic_mapping_name=YOUR_VALUE\", \"dynamic_mapping_vdom=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectFirewallAddress6DynamicMappingSubnetsegment:ObjectFirewallAddress6DynamicMappingSubnetsegment labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
