        "fortimanager:index/objectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile": {
            "description": "Configure MMS profiles.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/dupe %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallMmsprofileDupe`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/flood %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallMmsprofileFlood`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/notification %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallMmsprofileNotification`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/notifMsisdn %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallMmsprofileNotifmsisdn`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/outbreakPrevention %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallMmsprofileOutbreakprevention`\n\n## Import\n\nObjectFirewall MmsProfile can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "avnotificationtable": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "AntiVirus notification table ID.\n"
                },
                "bwordtable": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "MMS banned word table ID.\n"
                },
                "carrierEndpointPrefix": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable prefixing of end point values. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "carrierEndpointPrefixRangeMax": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Maximum length of end point value that can be prefixed (1 - 48).\n"
                },
                "carrierEndpointPrefixRangeMin": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Minimum end point length to be prefixed (1 - 48).\n"
                },
                "carrierEndpointPrefixString": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "String with which to prefix End point values.\n"
                },
                "carrierendpointbwltable": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Carrier end point filter table ID.\n"
                },
                "comment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Comment.\n"
                },
                "dupe": {
                    "$ref": "#/types/fortimanager:index/ObjectFirewallMmsprofileDupe:ObjectFirewallMmsprofileDupe",
                    "description": "Dupe. The structure of `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/dupe %}}` block is documented below.\n"
                },
                "dynamicSortSubtable": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "true or false, set this parameter to true when using dynamic forEach + toset to configure and sort sub-tables, please do not set this parameter when configuring static sub-tables.\n"
                },
                "extendedUtmLog": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable detailed UTM log messages. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "flood": {
                    "$ref": "#/types/fortimanager:index/ObjectFirewallMmsprofileFlood:ObjectFirewallMmsprofileFlood",
                    "description": "Flood. The structure of `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallMmsprofile:ObjectFirewallMmsprofile/properties/flood %}}` block is documented below.\n"
                },
                "mm1AddrHdr": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "HTTP header field (for MM1) containing user address.\n"
                },
                "mm1AddrSource": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Source for MM1 user address. Valid values: `http-header`, `cookie`.\n"
                },
                "mm1ConvertHex": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable converting user address from HEX string for MM1. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "mm1OutbreakPrevention": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable Virus Outbreak Prevention service. Valid values: `disabled`, `files`, `full-archive`.\n"
                },
                "mm1RetrDupe": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable duplicate scanning of MM1 retr. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "mm1RetrieveScan": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable scanning on MM1 retrieve configuration messages. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "mm1comfortamount": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "MM1 comfort amount (0 - 4294967295).\n"
                },
