        "fortimanager:index/objectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip": {
            "description": "Configure virtual IP for IPv4.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/dynamicMapping %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVipDynamicMapping:ObjectFirewallVipDynamicMapping %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/gslbPublicIps %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVipGslbpublicips:ObjectFirewallVipGslbpublicips %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/quic %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVipQuic:ObjectFirewallVipQuic %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/realservers %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallVipRealservers`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/sslCipherSuites %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectFirewallVipSslciphersuites`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/sslServerCipherSuites %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVipSslserverciphersuites:ObjectFirewallVipSslserverciphersuites %}}`\n\n\n\n## Example Usage\n\n\u003c!--Start PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n```hcl\npulumi {\n  required_providers {\n    fortimanager = {\n      source = \"pulumi/fortimanager\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"fortimanager_objectfirewallvip\" \"trname1\" {\n  arp_reply              = \"enable\"\n  color                  = 1\n  comment                = \"This is a Terraform example\"\n  extintf                = [\"any\"]\n  extip                  = \"192.168.1.1\"\n  http_redirect          = \"disable\"\n  name                   = \"terr-firewall-vip\"\n  nat_source_vip         = \"disable\"\n  portforward            = \"disable\"\n  ssl_client_fallback    = \"enable\"\n  ssl_server_algorithm   = \"client\"\n  ssl_server_max_version = \"client\"\n  ssl_server_min_version = \"client\"\n  type                   = \"static-nat\"\n}\nresource \"fortimanager_objectfirewallvip\" \"trname2\" {\n  realservers {\n    client_ips        = [\"3.3.3.3-4.4.4.4\", \"1.1.1.1-2.2.2.2\"]\n    healthcheck       = \"vip\"\n    holddown_interval = 300\n    ip                = \"10.11.1.11\"\n    port              = 80\n    status            = \"active\"\n    type              = \"ip\"\n  }\n  color                  = 22\n  name                   = \"wholezz\"\n  extaddrs               = \"\"\n  extintf                = \"any\"\n  extip                  = \"1.1.1.1-2.1.1.1\"\n  ssl_server_max_version = \"tls-1.2\"\n  type                   = \"server-load-balance\"\n  scopetype              = \"adom\"\n  adom                   = \"myadom\"\n}\n```\n```yaml\nresources:\n  trname1:\n    type: fortimanager:ObjectFirewallVip\n    properties:\n      arpReply: enable\n      color: 1\n      comment: This is a Terraform example\n      extintf:\n        - any\n      extip: 192.168.1.1\n      httpRedirect: disable\n      name: terr-firewall-vip\n      natSourceVip: disable\n      portforward: disable\n      sslClientFallback: enable\n      sslServerAlgorithm: client\n      sslServerMaxVersion: client\n      sslServerMinVersion: client\n      type: static-nat\n  trname2:\n    type: fortimanager:ObjectFirewallVip\n    properties:\n      realservers:\n        - clientIps:\n            - 3.3.3.3-4.4.4.4\n            - 1.1.1.1-2.2.2.2\n          healthcheck: vip\n          holddownInterval: 300\n          ip: 10.11.1.11\n          port: 80\n          status: active\n          type: ip\n      color: 22\n      name: wholezz\n      extaddrs: \"\"\n      extintf: any\n      extip: 1.1.1.1-2.1.1.1\n      sslServerMaxVersion: tls-1.2\n      type: server-load-balance\n      scopetype: adom\n      adom: myadom\n```\n\u003c!--End PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n\n## Import\n\nObjectFirewall Vip can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "addNat46Route": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable adding NAT46 route. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "arpReply": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable to respond to ARP requests for this virtual IP address. Enabled by default. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "color": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Color of icon on the GUI.\n"
                },
                "comment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Comment.\n"
                },
