                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/types/fortimanager:index/ObjectFirewallVipDynamicMapping:ObjectFirewallVipDynamicMapping"
                    },
                    "description": "Dynamic_Mapping. The structure of `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFirewallVip:ObjectFirewallVip/properties/dynamicMapping %}}` block is documented below.\n"
