        "fortimanager:index/objectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress:ObjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress": {
            "description": "Options for the DHCP server to assign IP settings to specific MAC addresses.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `reservedAddress` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFspVlanDhcpserver:ObjectFspVlanDhcpserver %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nObjectFsp VlanDhcpServerReservedAddress can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"vlan=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress:ObjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress labelname {{fosid}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "action": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Options for the DHCP server to configure the client with the reserved MAC address. Valid values: `assign`, `block`, `reserved`.\n"
                },
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress:ObjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress:ObjectFspVlanDhcpserverReservedaddress/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
