                    "description": "Enable/disable DDNS update override for DHCP. Valid values: `disable`, `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectFspVlanDynamicMappingDhcpserver:ObjectFspVlanDynamicMappingDhcpserver/properties/enable %}}`.\n"
                },
