        "fortimanager:index/objectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile": {
            "description": "Configure SCTP filter profiles.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile/properties/ppidFilters %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSctpfilterProfilePpidfilters:ObjectSctpfilterProfilePpidfilters %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nObjectSctpFilter Profile can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "comment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Comment.\n"
                },
