                    "description": "Ppid-Filters. The structure of `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSctpfilterProfile:ObjectSctpfilterProfile/properties/ppidFilters %}}` block is documented below.\n"
                },
                "scopetype": {
