        "fortimanager:index/objectSystemNpuNputcamMask:ObjectSystemNpuNputcamMask": {
            "description": "Mask fields of TCAM.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `mask` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSystemNpuNputcam:ObjectSystemNpuNputcam %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nObjectSystem NpuNpuTcamMask can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"npu_tcam=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectSystemNpuNputcamMask:ObjectSystemNpuNputcamMask labelname ObjectSystemNpuNpuTcamMask\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSystemNpuNputcamMask:ObjectSystemNpuNputcamMask/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectSystemNpuNputcamMask:ObjectSystemNpuNputcamMask/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "df": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "tcam mask ip flag df. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "dstip": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "tcam mask dst ipv4 address.\n"
                },
