                    "description": "The scope of application of the resource. Valid values: `inherit`, `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectUserRadiusDynamicMapping:ObjectUserRadiusDynamicMapping/properties/adom %}}`, `global`. The `inherit` means that the scopetype of the provider will be inherited, and adom will also be inherited. The default value is `inherit`.\n"
                },
                "secondarySecrets": {
                    "type": "array",
