        "fortimanager:index/objectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup": {
            "description": "Portal bookmark group.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `bookmarkGroup` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectVpnSslWebPortal:ObjectVpnSslWebPortal %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\nThe following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup/properties/bookmarks %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroupBookmarks:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroupBookmarks %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nObjectVpn SslWebPortalBookmarkGroup can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"portal=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/objectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroup/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "bookmarks": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/types/fortimanager:index/ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroupBookmark:ObjectVpnSslWebPortalBookmarkgroupBookmark"
