        "fortimanager:index/objectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap": {
            "description": "Configure Virtual Access Points (VAPs).\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/dynamicMapping %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVapDynamicMapping:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVapDynamicMapping %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/macFilterList %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVapMacfilterlist:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVapMacfilterlist %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/mpskKey %}}`: `fortimanagerObjectWirelesscontrollerVapMpskkey`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/portalMessageOverrides %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVapPortalmessageoverrides:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVapPortalmessageoverrides %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/vlanName %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVapVlanname:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVapVlanname %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVap:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap/properties/vlanPool %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FobjectWirelesscontrollerVapVlanpool:ObjectWirelesscontrollerVapVlanpool %}}`\n\n\n\n## Example Usage\n\n\u003c!--Start PulumiCodeChooser --\u003e\n```typescript\nimport * as pulumi from \"@pulumi/pulumi\";\nimport * as fortimanager from \"@pulumi/fortimanager\";\n\nconst trname = new fortimanager.ObjectWirelesscontrollerVap(\"trname\", {\n    _centmgmt: \"enable\",