        "fortimanager:index/packagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6": {
            "description": "Configure IPv6 DoS policies.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6/properties/anomaly %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nPackages FirewallDosPolicy6 can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"pkg_folder_path=YOUR_VALUE\", \"pkg=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/packagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6 labelname {{policyid}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
