        "fortimanager:index/packagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly": {
            "description": "Anomaly name.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `anomaly` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesFirewallDospolicy6:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6 %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nPackages FirewallDosPolicy6Anomaly can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"pkg_folder_path=YOUR_VALUE\", \"pkg=YOUR_VALUE\", \"dos_policy6=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/packagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly:PackagesFirewallDospolicy6Anomaly labelname {{name}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
