            "description": "Configuring policy6 for a policy block.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `firewallPolicy6` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesPblock:PackagesPblock %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nPackages PblockFirewallPolicy6 can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"pblock=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/packagesPblockFirewallPolicy6:PackagesPblockFirewallPolicy6 labelname {{policyid}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
