        "fortimanager:index/packagesPblockFirewallSecuritypolicy:PackagesPblockFirewallSecuritypolicy": {
            "description": "Configuring security policy for a policy block.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `firewallSecurityPolicy` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FpackagesPblock:PackagesPblock %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nPackages PblockFirewallSecurityPolicy can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"pblock=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/packagesPblockFirewallSecuritypolicy:PackagesPblockFirewallSecuritypolicy labelname {{policyid}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "action": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Policy action (accept/deny). Valid values: `deny`, `accept`.\n"
                },
