                        "description": "cp_all_objs - Assign all objects during global policy assignment. preview - Generate preview cache only. generateRev - Generate new ADOM revision before install. copyAssignedPkg - For global policy assignment - copy assigned package from ADOM to device. unassign - Remove global policy from ADOM. ifpolicyOnly - Only install interface policies. noIfpolicy - Install regular policies only - do not install interface policies. objsOnly - Install object(s) only - do not install any policies. autoLockWs - Automatically lock and unlock workspace when performing security console task. copyOnly - Only copy to device db. Valid values: `none`, `cpAllObjs`, `preview`, `generateRev`, `copyAssignedPkg`, `unassign`, `ifpolicyOnly`, `noIfpolicy`, `objsOnly`, `autoLockWs`, `checkPkgSt`, `copyOnly`.\n"
