        "fortimanager:index/systemGlobalSslciphersuites:SystemGlobalSslciphersuites": {
            "description": "Configure preferred SSL/TLS cipher suites\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `sslCipherSuites` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FsystemGlobal:SystemGlobal %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nSystem GlobalSslCipherSuites can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\n```sh\n\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/systemGlobalSslciphersuites:SystemGlobalSslciphersuites labelname {{cipher}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\n",
