            "description": "Configure redundant Internet connections with multiple outbound links and health-check profiles.\n\n\u003e The following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/duplication %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanDuplication:WantempSystemSdwanDuplication %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/healthCheck %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanHealthcheck:WantempSystemSdwanHealthcheck %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/healthCheckFortiguard %}}`: `fortimanagerWantempSystemSdwanHealthcheckfortiguard`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/members %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanMembers:WantempSystemSdwanMembers %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/neighbor %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanNeighbor:WantempSystemSdwanNeighbor %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/service %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanService:WantempSystemSdwanService %}}`\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan/properties/zone %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemSdwanZone:WantempSystemSdwanZone %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nWantemp SystemSdwan can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"wanprof=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/wantempSystemSdwan:WantempSystemSdwan labelname WantempSystemSdwan\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
