        "fortimanager:index/wantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor": {
            "description": "Create SD-WAN neighbor from BGP neighbor table to control route advertisements according to SLA status.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `neighbor` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlink:WantempSystemVirtualwanlink %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\n\n## Import\n\nWantemp SystemVirtualWanLinkNeighbor can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"wanprof=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/wantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor labelname {{sla_id}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "healthCheck": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "SD-WAN health-check name.\n"
                },
                "ip": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "IP address of neighbor.\n"
                },
                "member": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Member sequence number.\n"
                },
                "role": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Role of neighbor. Valid values: `primary`, `secondary`, `standalone`.\n"
                },
                "scopetype": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "The scope of application of the resource. Valid values: `inherit`, `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkNeighbor/properties/adom %}}`. The `inherit` means that the scopetype of the provider will be inherited, and adom will also be inherited. The default value is `inherit`.\n"
                },
