        "fortimanager:index/wantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService": {
            "description": "Create SD-WAN rules (also called services) to control how sessions are distributed to interfaces in the SD-WAN.\n\n\u003e This resource is a sub resource for variable `service` of resource `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlink:WantempSystemVirtualwanlink %}}`. Conflict and overwrite may occur if use both of them.\nThe following variables have sub resource. Avoid using them together, otherwise conflicts and overwrites may occur.\n\u003e- `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService/properties/sla %}}`: `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkServiceSla:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkServiceSla %}}`\n\n## Import\n\nWantemp SystemVirtualWanLinkService can be imported using any of these accepted formats:\nSet importOptions = [\"wanprof=YOUR_VALUE\"] in the provider section.\n\n```sh\n$ export \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"=\"true\"\n$ pulumi import fortimanager:index/wantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService labelname {{fosid}}\n$ unset \"FORTIMANAGER_IMPORT_TABLE\"\n```\n\u003e **Hint:** The scopetype and adom for import will directly inherit the scopetype and adom configuration of the provider.\n\n",
            "properties": {
                "addrMode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Address mode (IPv4 or IPv6). Valid values: `ipv4`, `ipv6`.\n"
                },
                "adom": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Adom. This value is valid only when the `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService/properties/scopetype %}}` is `{{% ref #/resources/fortimanager:index%2FwantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService:WantempSystemVirtualwanlinkService/properties/adom %}}`, otherwise the value of adom in the provider will be inherited.\n"
                },
                "bandwidthWeight": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Coefficient of reciprocal of available bidirectional bandwidth in the formula of custom-profile-1.\n"
                },
                "default": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable use of SD-WAN as default service. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "dscpForward": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable forward traffic DSCP tag. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "dscpForwardTag": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Forward traffic DSCP tag.\n"
                },
                "dscpReverse": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable reverse traffic DSCP tag. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "dscpReverseTag": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Reverse traffic DSCP tag.\n"
                },
                "dst": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Destination address name.\n"
                },
                "dst6": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Destination address6 name.\n"
                },
                "dstNegate": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable negation of destination address match. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "dynamicSortSubtable": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "true or false, set this parameter to true when using dynamic forEach + toset to configure and sort sub-tables, please do not set this parameter when configuring static sub-tables.\n"
                },
                "endPort": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "End destination port number.\n"
                },
                "fosid": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Priority rule ID (1 - 4000).\n"
                },
                "gateway": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable SD-WAN service gateway. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "groups": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "User groups.\n"
                },
                "healthCheck": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Health check.\n"
                },
                "holdDownTime": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Waiting period in seconds when switching from the back-up member to the primary member (0 - 10000000, default = 0).\n"
                },
                "inputDevice": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Source interface name.\n"
                },
                "inputDeviceNegate": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable negation of input device match. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "internetService": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Enable/disable use of Internet service for application-based load balancing. Valid values: `disable`, `enable`.\n"
                },
                "internetServiceAppCtrlGroup": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Application control based Internet Service group list.\n"
